    "title": "Mitsotakis in Al-Saraara: Protect the Christian populations in Syria",
    "text": "Prime Minister Kyriakos Mitsotakis met with Syrian interim President Ahmed Al Sharaa on the sidelines of the UN General Assembly in New York.\nDuring the meeting, the Prime Minister stressed the importance of an inclusive political process that will protect the rights of all minorities and made special reference to the need to protect Christian populations and the need to respect international law.\nKyriakos Mitsotakis underlined Greece’s readiness to support the reconstruction of Syria.\nAsk me anything\nExplore related questions",
